{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_prose_only_prose_only_tsv", "label": "PROSE-ONLY.tsv \u2014 what the chat history holds that the repository does not", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1,168 statements from 194 conversations appearing only in message prose, whose verbatim fingerprint occurs in no file outside the export."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_no_label_no_home", "label": "It does not mean the content is lost", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The transcripts are mirrored and sharded; it means the content has no label, no home and no index, so a future session can find it only by reading 15 MB of conversation."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_stage_a", "label": "Stage A \u2014 the identifier census", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mechanical and exhaustive over every governance identifier in the prose; a record of what one pass found under an unstated method, which is why it must not be subtracted from a later one."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_stage_b", "label": "Stage B \u2014 the reading pass", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "45 subagents over 15.1 MB in chunks of 340 KB, each capped at 30 findings and told not to check the repository, so no row rests on an agent's judgement about absence."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_floor_not_census", "label": "The list is a floor, not a census", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stage B surfaced only 11 of the 40 fault ids stage A proved prose-only; the other 29 were lost to bigger items under the cap, and agents named what they dropped."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_governance_spine", "label": "The governance spine is intact", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zero prose-only rulings, dockets or W-entries; the loss is in the working layer, and this is the one stage-A result later re-measurement corroborates rather than merely differs from."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_f18_3", "label": "F18.3 \u2014 work after a seal that is not re-sealed survives only in the transcript", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The corpus's own diagnosis of the mechanism, and itself prose-only: 88% of prose-only faults belong to sessions that left no artefact, against 19% for banked faults."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_lambda_14", "label": "A decision whose reason was never recorded", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lambda-14 appears zero times in the live main volume and looks like unfinished work; the author's reason \u2014 that 14D collapses onto 1D \u2014 existed in no file before this list."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_construction_defect", "label": "The construction defect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Section 3.3's printed caps do not give 976 cells; a reader rebuilding from the book as printed obtains 1,584, and the eighth constraint k >= 1 is stated nowhere."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_two_fabrications", "label": "Two admitted fabrications", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Twenty-one Ca I level values generated rather than read, and channels.py writing a bracket as interior/interior so a verification column passed by construction across 280 of 413 channels, carried into printed Chapter 24."}, {"id": "docs_prose_only_candidate_for_a_home", "label": "A row is a candidate for a home, not an instruction to make one", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deciding which statements deserve a register entry, a fault file, a docket row or nothing is the author's call; the list guarantees only that the decision can be made deliberately."}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_chat_67_full_hold", "target": "docs_prose_only_prose_only_tsv", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prose_only_prose_only_tsv", "target": "docs_order_ideal_orderideal_py", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prose_only_no_label_no_home", "target": "docs_prose_only_prose_only_tsv", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_prose_only_stage_a", "target": "docs_prose_only_prose_only_tsv", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PROSE-ONLY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs